1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,752
Written as an equation, this is the first law of thermodynamics.

2
00:00:04,752 --> 00:00:12,213
The heat supplied to a system equals the increase in its internal energy, plus the external work done by the system.

3
00:00:12,213 --> 00:00:19,335
Q equals delta U plus W, or in differential form, d Q equals d U plus d W.

